      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A Rubber Ducky is a USB device that looks like a regular flash drive but
    acts like a keyboard when plugged into a computer. It automatically types out
    pre-programmed keystrokes at high speed, executing commands or scripts without
    needing user input. \n\nOften used by security professionals for penetration
    testing, it can simulate a human typing, making it a powerful tool for exploiting
    systems if physical access is gained. In the wrong hands, it can be used to quickly
    deploy malware or extract sensitive data."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
